description:
SUSYLOVERS – we have a new challenge for you: check out what’s in @SusyMouriz's Watch History.

This Watch History has everything. K-drama shipping, rotating potato chips, what she watches to inspire her iconic fashion – even both a cat acting silly AND a monkey acting silly. She even talks about bonding with the other members of Proyecto Magenta (Liza Baez, Cecia Loaiza, and MARIANA), and her dream collab (HopeScope, we’re looking at you!). It’s exactly the kind of chaotic energy that fuels her creativity and keeps her fans guessing!

Well, as expected, her Watch History is “MEJOR QUE TU ❤️‍" (y que todo el mundo, claro).

